zΔ⚡b|=5d1d|+%3D%3D%3D Extensions %3D%3D%3D%0A|=a|+some modificatio|=1|+s and extensi|=1|+ns|=1|-2|+to the d|=1|-1|+ff form|=1|-1|+ts that are used and understood b|=2|+certain programs |=4|+in certain context|=1|-1|+. For example, s|=1|-1|+me [[revision control]]|=1|+sys|=1|+ems—suc|=1|+ as [[Subv|=1|+rsion|=1|-1|+(s|=1|+ftware)%7CSu|=1|+vers|=1|-1|+on]]—sp|=1|+cify a version|=7|+, "working copy", or|=3|+y other comment instea|=2|+of or in addition to a timestam|=1|+ in the diff's he|=1|+der |=1|-2|+ecti|=1|-3|+n.|=42cd|
